*.ps1
*.cmd
.task-watch-state

# Notes. CLAUDE.md and PROGRESS.md USED to be here too. CLAUDE.md is the
# handoff document — its whole purpose is that a new session or a new machine
# can pick the work up — and it existed on one machine. Tracked since
# 2026-09-28 (TASK T3), with PROGRESS.md, its dated record. TASK.md is only
# the current piece of work, i.e. scratch.
TASK.md
*.bak-*

